##  Blocking Or Non-Blocking?  ¶

With the default Transport Adapter in place, Requests does not provide any
kind of non-blocking IO. The [ ` Response.content  `
](../../api/#requests.Response.content "requests.Response.content") property
will block until the entire response has been downloaded. If you require more
